Breaks: patrone-gnome-taskbar (<< 0.4.12)
Description: file manager for PatroneOS
 Patrone File Manager is the file manager of PatroneOS, and it works
 the way Windows users expect: tabs, the command bar, breadcrumbs, the
 navigation pane with Quick access, Home, Gallery and Computer, eight views,
 the details and preview panes, full right-click menus, Folder Options and
 Properties, and copying, moving and deleting with progress, conflict
 handling and undo. It works with the Recycle Bin (the trash),
 removable drives and network places through GIO. It also draws the
 desktop and the desktop files panel, which Patrone's taskbar hosts.
